{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02684","headline":"和卫尉寺柳 · 杜之松","name":"和卫尉寺柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉将本屯营，辽河有戍城。\n大夫曾取姓，先生亦得名。\n高枝拂远鴈，疎影度遥星。\n不辞攀折苦，爲入管弦声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜之松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}